  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — first stable release. Full REST coverage (end-of-day and intraday prices, fundamentals,\ndividends and splits, exchanges and the calendar, news and sentiment, technical indicators, screener,\nmacro indicators, options, US Treasury rates, CBOE indices, ticker logos, tick data) plus live\nstreaming (WebSocket) for forex, crypto, and US trades and quotes. Async-first with synchronous\nwrappers; zero runtime dependencies.\n\nFull history: https://github.com/mrut2pac/EODHD.CSharpApiClient/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
